WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:03,070
Tie these two people up and throw them into the brigade

2
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:05,070
Do you dare to detain us?

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:06,940
Who will ask for someone?

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,940
Ask him to come to me with the official documents

5
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:20,140
You have to go up the mountain again

6
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,560
A big disaster happened in the back mountain

7
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,560
You are now pregnant with two children

8
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,560
Don't follow me out

9
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,360
Then you promise me

10
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,360
Don't risk your life

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,000
I am more careful than anyone else now

12
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:34,090
I'm still waiting to see

13
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:35,090
Our two little cubs have just landed.

14
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:41,890
The door is almost dead

15
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:42,890
I'm here

16
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:43,890
The sky won't fall down
